          "settings": {
            "label": "OUR STORY",
            "heading": "Bridging the Gulf & India",
            "body_text": "<p>Gulf Souq was born from a simple yet profound realization: millions of Indian families have deep connections to the Arabian Gulf, yet access to authentic Gulf products in India remains limited.</p><p>We set out to change that. Today, Gulf Souq stands as India's premier destination for authentic imported Gulf products – from the sacred Ajwa dates of Madinah to the luxurious attars of Arabia, from premium chocolates to elegant modest wear.</p><p>Every product is handpicked, every shipment is carefully curated, and every customer is treated like family. Because at Gulf Souq, we're not just selling products – we're delivering a piece of the Gulf to every Indian home.</p>",
